<title>USA: Broad National Bancorp sets share buyback.</title>
<headline>Broad National Bancorp sets share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, New Jersey 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Broad National Bancorporation said on Thursday its board had authorised the repurchase of up to 100,000 of its outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>The company said it expected to buy back the shares from time to time in the open market, subject to market conditions.</p>
<p>At September 30, 1996, Broad had 4,677,410 common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>The company said the repurchased shares would be held in treasury and may be used for general corporate purposes including stock-based employee benefit plans and stock dividends.</p>
</text>
